{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-04-11 08:45:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA CFO JORGE GOMEZ RESIGNS TO ASSUME CFO POSITION AT ANOTHER PUBLIC COMPANY', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., APRIL 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA” OR “THE COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: XRAY)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER JORGE GOMEZ HAS RESIGNED FROM THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE MAY 6, 2022, TO ASSUME A CFO POSITION AT ANOTHER PUBLIC COMPANY. THE COMPANY IS INITIATING A SEARCH PROCESS TO IDENTIFY ITS NEXT CFO.'}